{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:12:28.054Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"04925ce7adb6c07bd982043dc5a6eaad9f5bd25ee007e7d3acafe78b572263bb","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests show. Two of the four owners are only implied, and Quillfeather's isn't stated.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato owns it now. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until it changed hands on **2026-05-04**. The 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms it was reassigned in the CRM that day. The 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato owns it. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management of Vantorre Mobility today\". The 2025 digests already called it \"Gideon's fleet account\", so the 5/4 wording is a bit unclear. I'd treat him as the owner.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato appears to own it. The 12/1/2025 digest and the 9/30/2026 digest both call it \"Gideon's medical account\". The March 2025 digest had it as Nadia's, but no digest gives the date it moved.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't find a named owner. The digests only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\", and no digest assigns it to a person. Nadia is only mentioned as hosting a training session for it. Please confirm the owner directly before it goes on the slide.\n\nThe digests never name the accounts by owner, so for the board slide I'd check the CRM, especially for Orlavine and Quillfeather."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
